# What the sdist carries beyond the package (the wheel is unaffected).
# examples/toy: the six-query fixtures the README quickstart runs, so a user
# with only the sdist can follow it. examples/scifact (2.9 MB) stays out.
# tests/ are not shipped: they need examples/scifact, docs/ and .github/, so
# a half-shipped test suite would only fail. tests/test_release.py checks the
# built sdist against these rules.
graft examples/toy
prune tests
